From 32635968b72efa9705b9a7b6019985388878057e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chad Cormier Roussel <chadcormierroussel@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 09:38:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] msvcp: Implement std::_Throw_Cpp_error.

It throws the std::system_error of the STL's thread error codes, as
std::thread and std::unique_lock call it (MSVC STL thread0.cpp); the stub
ended the process instead. Age of Empires II DE's main thread called it
while starting its UI thread.
---
 dlls/msvcp110/msvcp110.spec         |  2 +-
 dlls/msvcp120/msvcp120.spec         |  2 +-
 dlls/msvcp120_app/msvcp120_app.spec |  2 +-
 dlls/msvcp140/msvcp140.spec         |  2 +-
 dlls/msvcp90/exception.c            | 23 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 dlls/msvcp_win/msvcp_win.spec       |  2 +-
 6 files changed, 28 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

